# Secrets
.env

# Alias worksheet written by scripts/config_helper.py scaffold. Deliberately not
# tracked: config/aliases.yaml is the hand-maintained file CLAUDE.md protects,
# and a committed near-identical draft beside it is an invitation to edit the
# wrong one. Regenerate it whenever it is needed.
config/aliases.draft.yaml

# Generated data. Regenerable from raw or upstream sources — pykrx will serve
# 2024 prices again in 2030, FRED keeps decades of history.
#
# News is the exception, and not a small one. RSS serves a rolling 50–120 item
# buffer with no history, so an hour not collected is gone permanently.
# Collection runs in GitHub Actions, where the runner is destroyed after each
# job, so committing is the only thing that makes this data exist tomorrow.
# SPEC §0 principle 3 calls raw data the future backtest dataset; for news that
# is true only because of the exception below.
#
# The stepwise form is required, not stylistic: git cannot re-include a path
# whose parent directory is excluded, so every level has to be opened in turn.
data/*
!data/raw/
data/raw/*
!data/raw/kr/
data/raw/kr/*
!data/raw/kr/news/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# OS
.DS_Store
